laya-bangla
Copyright 2026 laya-bangla contributors

This project is a Bangla-focused adaptation of Laya by Convai Innovations.
Its training code uses the upstream `laya.train` and `laya.calibrate` modules.

Upstream source: https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Upstream model family: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
Base checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual

The upstream source and model cards declare the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This repository contains original data-preparation, training, evaluation, and
playground tools, synthetic diagnostic examples, project documentation, and
configuration. Upstream model weights and third-party dataset text are not
bundled with it; `laya-bangla prepare` downloads datasets from their publishers
under their own licenses (see docs/datasets.md).

laya-bangla is an independent project. References to upstream names identify
the origin of the work and do not imply endorsement.
